# Ella Sun villa videos — keep heavy AI-generated source/intermediate media OUT of git.
# Only the FINAL deliverables (final/*.mp4) + READMEs are tracked, so they can be
# pulled/edited from any machine without bloating the repo with the full 1.8GB.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!**/README.md
!**/final/*.mp4

# The 416MB Cocos master exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file hard limit — never track it.
ella-sun/villa-cocos/final/וילה*.mp4

# EXCEPTION (2026-07-15): villa-cocos 9:16 short prep is tracked so work can
# continue across machines (12 AI shots, frames, VO). ~250MB, all files <100MB.
!ella-sun/villa-cocos/_cocos_short_prep/**

# EXCEPTION (2026-07-22): villa-mountain 9:16 reel working set is tracked so work can
# continue across machines (11 shots, 8 VO lines, 9:16 source images, build script). ~61MB.
!ella-sun/villa-mountain/_mountain_reel_prep/**

# EXCEPTION (2026-08-11): villa-shikma — track the deliverables + inputs, NOT the
# heavy re-derivable intermediates. Keep: 37 photos, VO scripts (.md), VO wavs, and
# the final assembled videos (full tour + 3 part finals). Drop the ~500MB of raw
# Kling shots/, composited frames/, and trim//norm/ intermediates (regenerable / paid
# media stays off git per the policy above). So Shikma pulls to the MacBook at ~200MB.
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/**/*.md
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/photos/*.jpg
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/vo/*.wav
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/shikma_FULL_tour_card.mp4
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/shikma_FULL_tour_VO.mp4
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/part1_exterior/shikma_part1_exterior.mp4
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/part2_interior/shikma_part2_interior.mp4
!ella-sun/villa-shikma/part3_bedrooms/shikma_part3_bedrooms.mp4

# mini-villa VO script (the long-tour narration) — keep it with the project.
!ella-sun/mini-villa/villa_mini_VO_script.md
# The pre-shower-cut backup is redundant once the no-shower tour is the deliverable.
ella-sun/mini-villa/final/mini_villa_TOUR_orig_withshower.mp4
